        "sortDate": "2021-07-01",
        "summary": "This work introduces a fast, lightweight AI system that can instantly tell whether someone is searching to explore a topic broadly or to find a specific answer. By understanding this intent in real time, search engines can deliver more accurate results and better suggestions to help people find what they need faster.",
